Research LoRA adapter modifications for the GGD hero-forging experiments.

The Gemma 4 base model is provided by Google. The MLX 8-bit conversion used
here is mlx-community/gemma-4-12B-it-8bit, revision
200bb6db075e137a4deb08838865ac4ddb86292e.

The included research adapters are modified parameters produced by the local
fine-tuning experiments documented in the associated manifests and reports.
They are not original upstream checkpoints, are not production-qualified,
and are not endorsed by Google, Qwen, or the MLX community.

Google's Gemma 4 license reference: https://ai.google.dev/gemma/apache_2
Historical Qwen base identities and retained notices are in the archived
model cards, receipts and LICENSE files. See LICENSE-MODELS for Apache 2.0.
